# Git mailmap
#
# GitHub maps any <login>@users.noreply.github.com address to the owner of that
# login. Six commits on 2026-10-22 were authored as
# <mikel@users.noreply.github.com>, which belongs to the unrelated
# github.com/mikel account rather than to this project's author.
#
# This file keeps `git shortlog`, `git log` and other tooling from repeating
# that mistake locally. The published history has been rewritten as well, so
# the GitHub contributors graph no longer attributes those commits elsewhere.

Mikel Aramendia <mikel.aramendia.lacalle@gmail.com> <mikel@users.noreply.github.com>
